(text "Both ground straps must be fitted before the signal cable. Keep raw and protected battery returns separate from these main-board grounds." (at 85.09 505.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid f9c10209-c046-550f-87d7-64e53e335187))
(text "The shell uses two parallel 0.33 ohm returns at each connector. Numbered ground conductors connect directly to the local ground plane." (at 85.09 515.62 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid c2bc6aa5-8df6-5f6b-9560-eb28812a5007))
